    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoshuwa goobalool buuneeda aba ng'asheega huuydean",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ning'ata eawoojiga saang'a, nea ninung' NG'UTAMIIDA gafuuf fuga Israeli aba weajoodiga nyaawa sean neaweesa saawa abeeda Yoshuwa ea niwaasiit ak gaba gweanyeeka saang'a, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean ghabwada geat Yoshuwa fuga Israeli sean, gweargwa nyaawa ea fuga nyaawa hees, ea fuga nyaawa aheeldooschi buuneeda ak gwayeesha saawa, “Aniini naawaasiichi ak geabeay gweanyeeka saang'a; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea noadaayi ng'asheega sean sissa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA eemoojisu seaniin aba badaydeang'wa, aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA gang'uchi aba badahuukeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula, ghaaloacheegwa ahearana eemoojisu abidiin, sea eemoojiga sean jea dasaja jeeda fugaaschi, ghang'eada Yordani ea ghwahita basooda haw mida heeda biyeara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA gayghwayiin saawa madeedeang'wa, ak gayghahoan saawa aba madeedeang'wa; ak gajoombala ng'eanyiida nyaawa, gawuurji gidaghayi rukuteayda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi awoosa meanyi muuchi nea ghoang'waanyi ak goosinyi ng'asheega sean sing'oorsa jeeda gitaabooda deaweedeeda Musa, adooyamsi geat meatkweenuut bea geatinda dugwa ghana geatinda ghaadaam, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "adiidu googuuyeewi eemoojisu siipuusa bugusteang'wean, nea adiidu goorugu gheawunga aseecheeka nyaawa, ghana ayaaga habeawooda aba badayda nyaawa, ghana agadiyeesiina saawa, ghana atukung'siina saawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghoabwati NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA gawuurji gidoosindi ea ghoah ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA nihoan aba madeedeang'wa eemoojiga hees bea uurjeenga; ak aba heedeang'wa, ea manda siida nimiinaada aba madeedeang'wa askwearjoojisu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siyagi aba jeedeang'wa gayghahoan fih sagalama, aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA gang'uchi aba badahuukeagwa, gawuurji gidaghayi rukuteayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashageada geat, ak ghoabwariinyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama inyas goobiikti bwadaw, ak ghoaghasi geat boosteangeaba eemoojisu ghayi sinung'usa bugusteang'wean, ak googeenyi sea saawa, ak googeenay gadeemga nyaawa, nea ghaghi saawa geagwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda ghoanali huumwa gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA maygudu ghahoan eemoojisu aba madeedeang'wa; ak aba heedeang'wa gayghoah ghuduumbwaada ea ghealooda, ea bileangida aba gisheajeegeagwa, ea halaghweenga aba gheanyangeagwa, bwak ea ooshealana ak gooriteawi ng'eanyiini miy ghayi gooneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANg'wean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak ghamneawa aniini gaydabisa dami aba jeeda ng'eanyiida, ak ghoanali gurooruunatkeagwa ea jeesingeagwa, oagasean, gideaba miighoashoanyaneegwa ng'ashaan aba jeeda haleanjeeda miyaasiin sean ghayi rugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA ng'asheega sean nisa aba heedeang'wa, manda eara ng'asheanjagi ashoanyaneegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gidaghayi rarsiindaneegwa ng'asheega miyaasiin sean NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, nea gwayi gaygagooneegwa, hean abeeda NG'UTAMIIDA gaygweadu ng'asheega munyas sean badahuukeagwa, bwak ea ghwanung' ooshealana aba ng'eanyiini miy gooneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANg'wean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inyas ea moang'waanyi neajeeda rukuneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, ak gooweayi agadiyeesiina aseecheeka suuk nea gootkung'usi saawa. Abeeda gayghwahidu nyarasta NG'UTAMIIDA badaydeang'wa, ak gajeenung' ooshealana damandida aba jeeda ng'eanyiida miy ghayi gooneegwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
